      "statement": "Because a store can accept and ignore precondition headers, celld provokes the two required rejections on a unique probe/cas- object at startup (skippable with CELLD_STORAGE_PROBE=0), separating a permanent store Violation that may stop a node from an ambiguous error that may be served through.",
