      "id": "claim_7dbd676f5e0942509f23f89c39a06ff8",
      "statement": "The bucket client's error contract is that a conditional write returns a clean rejection only for 412/409 (Precondition/AlreadyExists); every other failure is treated as ambiguous and kept as an error, and a response without a CAS token is an error.",
