    {
      "id": "claim_98e3956ac134411398884589597f86a6",
      "statement": "The output gate holds every state-revealing egress: a local write opens a barrier keyed to its committed position and emits AwaitDurable, a read-only output trails the cell's newest barrier, an output whose request is no longer live on the writing epoch fails DurabilityUnproven, and the shell's WebSocket write barriers release strictly in write order.",
