      "id": "claim_905971253d5e4524ab034aa84b7ff81e",
      "statement": "After a bucket proof the core emits VerifyOwnership, a plain read of the ownership record that must still name this node at this epoch; a fleet proof settles without the read because a takeover seals members before restoring, and a failed verification refuses the write rather than acknowledging into an orphaned lineage.",
