      "id": "claim_b1b40fdcefa24931ad9bd3e78d47a8be",
      "statement": "CELLD_DURABILITY defaults to fleet: each node streams captured-but-unuploaded L0 LTX segments to a follower ensemble over signed peer HTTP, and a write acknowledges when every member holds it on disk or when the unchanged bucket upload proves first, whichever wins.",
