    {
      "id": "claim_cd734ec8aab94732a739411f6ec6b205",
      "statement": "The ensemble recruits up to two followers (three acknowledged copies) and keeps acknowledging while one remains; follower loss degrades to bucket acks until a periodic re-recruit CASes a fresh ensemble; slow appends can be hedged with an idempotent second copy (adaptive by default, CELLD_LOG_HEDGE_MS fixed or 0 off); and sustained gray followers are evicted by the log_evict policy built from the environment.",
