      "id": "claim_ac3feeac166f4fd8be2ed7c9d633159f",
      "statement": "A restore selects the newest epoch prefix under cells/<cell>/ltx/ that holds any LTX data and replays its full contiguous chain from transaction zero; the epoch seal that once capped this read was deleted because recovery or bundle drains can append acknowledged tails after an earlier cut, while unacknowledged stale tails violate no promise.",
