    {
      "id": "claim_62af1e5f25e347e9b8c2d28fab87a895",
      "statement": "Each node publishes an expiring lease in the bucket renewed at one third of CELLD_TTL_MS (default 10 s); a renewal that lands at or after the prior lease's expiry fences the node because peers were already entitled to seize its cells and the ownership CAS is guarded on the ownership record's etag, and routing checks the published expiry so requests are safe even before the fence runs.",
